usage: archive-https-rounds.py [-h] [--round {47,48,49,50,51}] --report REPORT
                               [--write-archive] [--all-consumers-finished]
                               [--final-proof FINAL_PROOF]

Local exact nonbinary evidence archiver for R47-R51. Default prepare never
seals. Write mode requires the coordinator's explicit all-consumers-finished
declaration and an exact-hash final-proof file. This script never stops
processes, follows artifact reference paths, opens private keys/databases/live
control capabilities, or cleans source roots. A failed partial archive is
retained, never retried over.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --round {47,48,49,50,51}
  --report REPORT
  --write-archive
  --all-consumers-finished
  --final-proof FINAL_PROOF
